# Keep the image build hermetic: the builder stage installs its own deps, and a
# local .env.local must never reach it (it holds a Clerk secret, and any
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* in it would be inlined into the bundle -- silently making the
# image environment-specific again).
node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
.git
.gitignore
e2e
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
Containerfile
README.md
